AB  - The proceedings contain 10 papers. The topics discussed include: testing mobile apps: challenges, state of the art and future trends; Canvas MVP: an agile tool for digital transformation; testing environmental models supported by machine learning; test framework for Jenkins shared library; testing strategies for smart cities applications: a systematic mapping study; assessing agile testing practices for enterprise systems: a survey approach; gamification in software testing: a characterization study; a study on the impact of model evolution in MBT suites; evaluating the impact of different testers on model-based testing; using a search and model based framework to improve robustness tests in cloud platforms; mutation operators for code annotations; and mutation operators for code annotations.
