AD  - Physiology of Exercise Laboratory Research Group, Department of Health and Human Performance, Faculty of Physical Activity and Sport Science, Universidad Politécnica de Madrid, Madrid, Spain
AD  - Department of Physical Education and Sport, Graduate School of Health Sciences, Anadolu University, Eskisehir, Turkey
