TI  - The mobile app usability inspection (MAUi) framework as a guide for minimal viable product (MVP) testing in lean development cycle
PY  - 2016
T2  - Proceedings of CHIuXiD 2016, the 2nd International Human Computer Interaction and User Experience Conference in Indonesia: Bridging the Gaps in the HCI and UX World
SP  - 1
