AB  - This chapter offers a thorough examination of different architectural patterns used in mobile application development as well as declarative iOS programming. The significance of choosing appropriate architectural patterns for guaranteeing mobile applications’ scalability, flexibility, and maintainability is examined. It compares the advantages and disadvantages of architectural patterns including MVP, MVVM, VIPER, and MVC. It also looks at declarative programming paradigms, highlighting the benefits of readability and productivity. The effectiveness of declarative programming is demonstrated using SwiftUI. The chapter explains the distinctions between imperative and declarative programming approaches with code samples, emphasizing the better readability and conciseness of the latter. © 2025 selection and editorial matter, Budati Anil Kumar, Akella Ramakrishna, Goutham Makkena and Gheorghita Ghinea; individual chapters, the contributors.
