AB  - With the progress of science and technology and the improvement of living standards, people hope to seek a simple, scientific and convenient health management mode through scientific health care and health care in the fast-paced life. Mobile medical health management platform system is based on Linux environment Raspberry PI as the hardware platform, integrated artificial intelligence (AI), Raspberry PI (RPI), mobile phone app, Internet of things and other technologies, designed and developed a mobile medical health management platform system integrating medical treatment, health care and health care. The platform uses 4B+ Raspberry PI as the design main control system module, the control of heart rate, blood oxygen, temperature and other medical function sub-module and other auxiliary system hardware module; The mobile app part adopts MVC framework, uses Android studio development environment, and uses SQLite database to build mobile phone management interface. The test subjects log in to the mobile app through face recognition, the system compares the test data with the parameter values of cloud computing and big data, displays the health information of the test subjects on the mobile screen, provides personalized treatment plans or health guidance suggestions, and automatically backs up the test registration form. The product can realize man-machine interface information display, face recognition, voice interaction, real-time monitoring and other functions, which can save people's unnecessary time to see a doctor, relieve the pressure of many hospital patients, and is essential for people's health and longevity. Therefore, this topic has high research and development value. © 2025 IEEE.
