AB  - The proceedings contain 35 papers. The topics discussed include: mathematical optimization model of parking capacity for parking area in triangular shape; android application: skin abnormality analysis based on edge detection technique; a tale of two development approach: empirical study on the maintainability and modularity of android mobile application with anti-pattern and model-view-presenter design pattern; a user authentication scheme using real-time location, QR-code, and one time password: a preliminary work; weighting factor mechanism of uncited papers to improve the fairness of RA-index based on particle swarm optimization; analysis of C-dump converter for SRM drives; impedance influence analysis on multi spectral capacitive sensor; study of statistical prevention mechanism in integrated microelectronic device manufacturing; modified rate control for collision-aware in minstrel-HT rate adaptation algorithm; and three dimensional model of snake-type wavemakers using linear wave theory.
